    "title": "WATCH | KSHB 41's Wes Peery explains the colors of the Northern Lights - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KSHB 41 News Staff ,\n5 hours ago As the Northern Lights continue to paint the sky across the Kansas City area, KSHB 41 meteorologist Wes Peery breaks down what makes the lights so colorful.\nWatch Peery's explainer in the video player below.\nKSHB 41's Wes Peery explains the colors of the Northern LightsViewers sent Peery pictures of the light show Thursday night.\nPeery suggested checking out the show in the sky by using night mode on your camera.\nAnother viewer took a picture while on a flight coming into Kansas City International Airport.\n—",
